.TH QUERY-CLI 1
.SH NAME
query-cli \- query a bounded offline SEV evidence snapshot
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B query-cli resources --tool TOOL
.br
.B query-cli query --tool TOOL --query-id ID [--limit N]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Lists approved resources or executes a declared read-only query against the replay service. Raw SQL and direct snapshot access are unsupported.
.SH ERRORS
Malformed requests, denied or missing resources, unsupported operations, limits, and infrastructure failures return non-success responses without revealing hidden resources.
